  "limitations": [
    "One historical SPY path, seed1, adaptively censored suffix; no generalization, financial significance, profitability or trading-cost evidence.",
    "Stock scores use observed noisy returns relative to zero, not synthetic clean MSE; large synthetic factor gains are not numerically comparable.",
    "Unchanged helper target scaling/centering and clipping retained; final feature is two bars before target and forecast occurs after intervening normalization bar.",
    "These are transferred sparse linear predictive filters, not an implementation of a general replacement optimizer inside arbitrary neural networks."
  ],
  "next_research_implication": "A stock method must preserve weak distributed correlated predictive information while suppressing noise. The static sparse prior mostly abstains; fixed-share resets reintroduce large prediction energy without compensating target correlation. Stock transfer, not further synthetic endpoint optimization, must gate any promotion."
